Package: com.niubiprass.minisagentd
Name: Minis Agent Daemon
Version: 0.2.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Privileged post-install worker for Minis tweak development.
 Installs a verified deb, optionally resprings and reports the result.
 Builds nothing.
Maintainer: niubiprass
Author: niubiprass
Section: Development
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
